#: includes/class-wellactually-settings.php:504
msgid "The \"Well, Actually...\" screen sorts posts into its Needs to be set up / Has AI suggestions / In swipe deck views using a summary field kept alongside each post. If that summary ever gets out of step — a post showing up as needing setup when it's already excluded, say, or a drafted suggestion you can't reach — this rebuilds it from scratch. Safe to run at any time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wellactually-settings.php:523
msgid "What the AI is told before it sees each post — the place to describe your own voice, subject matter, and what makes a good swipe statement for your readers. Leave blank to use the wording shown above, which is what the plugin ships with."
msgstr ""

