msgid "You don't need to mention the response format: the instruction below is always added for you, so a rewrite can't stop drafts being read back properly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wellactually-settings.php:566
msgid "How many posts to draft at the same time. Drafting spends nearly all of its time waiting on the AI provider, so sending several requests at once is much faster than one after another — 5 is roughly five times quicker than 1. Lower this if your provider starts refusing requests for being too frequent."
msgstr ""

